  "modifications": [
    "Responsibility-based GTNR packages; only EU, speed and parallel modules",
    "Separate ModularUI2 module settings screen",
    "Numbered cross-recipe tasks with live per-machine thread limits, power sharing, NBT and buffered outputs",
    "Current / total Waila counters; duplicate module types invalidate formation",
    "Optional Markdown; detached tooltip instances; no checkMachine probing",
    "Markdown controls description italics, following the merged PR #654 review",
    "Independent and cumulative structure tiers, material tiers, variable-length layers, per-layer hatches and shared casing totals",
    "Structure probes retain actual projector stack sizes and isolate material sub-channels",
    "Detached full-range voltage, coil, glass, casing, pressure and parallel-controller probes; scoped state restoration",
    "Real calculator heat rules, perfect-overclock thresholds and recipe tier limits; read-only GT5 accessors",
    "No upstream controller registrations, execution cores or wireless scheduler"
  ],
